# Forensic Gadgeteer: "Activated abilities of artifacts you control cost {1} less to activate." Retrofitter Foundry's
# "{3}: Untap this artifact" costs {2}: two tapped Moxen pay it with nothing left in the pool, so the reduction is exactly one (a
# larger reduction would leave a mana floating, none would leave the cost owed). The Gadgeteer is cast on turn 1 with
# three Moxen; the Foundry is an artifact spell cast after it, so it investigates.

